    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Orbs of Duality</i> is a simple but challenging puzzle game with elements from <strong>Sokoban</strong> and <strong>Minesweeper</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to <strong>neutralize all walls</strong> that have <strong>fire</strong> or <strong>water</strong> inside them, with the opposite elements which is found around the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/998ec042e11e87ba7aa87e20da714954.poster.avif?t=1755111818\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/998ec042e11e87ba7aa87e20da714954.webm?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/998ec042e11e87ba7aa87e20da714954.mp4?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, more mechanics are added, such as <strong>combining adjacent elements</strong> to form larger ones (contributing 2 points to nearby walls), or <strong>splitting</strong> them apart:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/fb3a33a111a400b0000bff200b00f0ea.poster.avif?t=1755111818\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/fb3a33a111a400b0000bff200b00f0ea.webm?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/fb3a33a111a400b0000bff200b00f0ea.mp4?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and <strong>bombs</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/74f06a6f7590462fb5fa1472d2a64e37.poster.avif?t=1755111818\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/74f06a6f7590462fb5fa1472d2a64e37.webm?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/74f06a6f7590462fb5fa1472d2a64e37.mp4?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo currently includes <strong>over</strong>\u00a0<strong>27 carefully hand-crafted levels</strong> but there are more to come.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Orbs of Duality</i> is a simple but challenging puzzle game with elements from <strong>Sokoban</strong> and <strong>Minesweeper</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to <strong>neutralize all walls</strong> that have <strong>fire</strong> or <strong>water</strong> inside them, with the opposite elements which is found around the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/998ec042e11e87ba7aa87e20da714954.poster.avif?t=1755111818\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/998ec042e11e87ba7aa87e20da714954.webm?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/998ec042e11e87ba7aa87e20da714954.mp4?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, more mechanics are added, such as <strong>combining adjacent elements</strong> to form larger ones (contributing 2 points to nearby walls), or <strong>splitting</strong> them apart:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/fb3a33a111a400b0000bff200b00f0ea.poster.avif?t=1755111818\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/fb3a33a111a400b0000bff200b00f0ea.webm?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/fb3a33a111a400b0000bff200b00f0ea.mp4?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and <strong>bombs</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/74f06a6f7590462fb5fa1472d2a64e37.poster.avif?t=1755111818\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/74f06a6f7590462fb5fa1472d2a64e37.webm?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615210/extras/74f06a6f7590462fb5fa1472d2a64e37.mp4?t=1755111818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo currently includes <strong>over</strong>\u00a0<strong>27 carefully hand-crafted levels</strong> but there are more to come.</p>",
    "short_description": "Master puzzles by wielding fire and water! Push, combine, and transform the elements with mind-teasing puzzles inspired by Sokoban and Minesweeper.",
